{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "b1d3f9a0-1111-4c4a-9c2a-cinenow2026",
		"name": "CineNow API",
		"description": "Postman collection for the CineNow OTT platform (Laravel + Sanctum).\n\n**How to use:**\n1. Set the `base_url` collection variable (e.g. `http://localhost/cinenow/public`).\n2. Hit `Auth > Login`. The test script automatically saves the returned token into the `token` variable.\n3. All protected endpoints use `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` via the collection-level auth.\n\nAll endpoints are registered under the `/api` prefix. Query-string parameters shown are the common ones accepted by controllers; many list endpoints also accept `lang`, `page`, `limit`, `type`, `search`, `genre_id`, `language_id`, `country_id`, etc.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost/cinenow/public", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "user_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "movie_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "tvshow_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "episode_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "video_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "livetv_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "genre_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "castcrew_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "plan_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "coupon_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "profile_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "page_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "notification_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" }
